Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who'd been wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we fixed him up, he couldn't\Nbelieve we were being so nice to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things seem fairly quiet for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, quiet never lasts long here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}O Wind! O Light! SaberLeomon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sounds familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give me any of your job, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.18,0:02:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, we need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me here with\Nthis whacked out monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supreme, I'm fired up and\Nready to go on a main street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down, you four-footed giant furball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is certainly more convenient\Nthan waiting for a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd known we were gonna go\Nriding, I'd have worn long pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a side saddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place doesn't look very lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kinda spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna barf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the restaurant where\Nthey made me work like a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still trying to get that greasy\Nspoon smell out of my sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be Nero Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we'd better find shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not even a clean chair to sit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon, you are not going\Nto believe what you missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am truly happy to have finally\Nreturned and helped my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot has happened to me since being set
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:04:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,free of the Black Gears\Nand their evil power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being exposed to the Digivice\Nhas now enabled me to Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there is one problem. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am unable to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't learned the secret yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all still new to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you special, you\Noversized doggy, Chew Toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just see how many\Nlives you have left. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dirty cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing more\Npathetic than a whiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly you don't deserve\Nto be called a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing we want\Nto do is cause trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Palmon, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They delivered the triple\Nhot fun sundae. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, the princess would look! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess, Meadie, yippee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.94,0:05:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we are shooting at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they don't invite Puppetmon\Nto their birthday parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's a good thing that they're\Nfinally releasing their hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys know you're not allowed upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My room is off-limits, but\NI hate sharing my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say that you need to learn a\Nlittle more about good manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not hurting\Nanything except maybe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've had it with you, Puppetmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now you want to play, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a game of follow the leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here, you cutie toothpick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You play with us and you're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:05:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not our best move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, putt punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, TJ, I have friends after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem is, they don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what they don't like, they destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Vegiemon have\Nextremely volatile tempers,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.47,0:06:22.44,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}RedVeggiemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.47,0:06:22.44,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.47,0:06:22.44,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.47,0:06:22.44,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Plant Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.47,0:06:22.44,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.47,0:06:22.44,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Hazard Breath
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's why their faces are always\Nred, not exactly the friendly type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to do some wig-whacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you two were hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to your palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The palace was completely destroyed\Nby those creepy Dark Masters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They attacked just for the fun of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all had to run for our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all separated and we've\Nbeen hiding here ever since!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys make me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do they think they are, anyway,\Npicking on poor, defenseless Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, is that fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Darkmasters have to be\Nstopped if we expect to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spent all this time searching\Nfor you, but it hasn't been easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Darkmasters have seen to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two have the power\Nto defeat those beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you must work together and join\Nforces with the other Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only then will you succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying we wasted our\Ntime fighting everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I could have stained\Nmy clothes with perspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.94,0:07:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would have fought\Nthose guys at the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would have broken way\Nmore than just a sweat. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.48,0:07:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about the good Digimon on File
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Island that sacrificed\Nthemselves to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you were brought to File Island to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prove that you were capable\Nof working as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could have been a test to make\Nsure that you were the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did we pass? You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It actually makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Devimon had defeated you, then you would\Nnot be ready for this bigger challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon's power was nothing\Ncompared to the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was merely the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've proven yourselves over and over
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by defeating one evil\NDigimon after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're ready to take on the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we must find\Nyour friends immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do this all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of us needed a\Ntimeout from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You needed a timeout?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you might say it's\Nanother kind of test.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electroshockers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are not as useful as a\Nload of stinky rotten vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stop us now! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon, one Digimon! Turn! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.52,0:09:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you're so smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody toys with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got me strung up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it'll make me do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijimam!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, we won!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijimam! Nijimam!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijimam, get yourself, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:09:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijimam, get yourself, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:09:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijimam, get yourself, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijimam!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep running, kids, I\Ndon't want to catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kabuterimon digimon 2
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mega kabuterimon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:10:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stronger than I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate them, Puppet\NMon, or it could be disastrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit it out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that I might lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only saying, take them seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined have something you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got more powers than I ever will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fools, I'm never gonna lose to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know something you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's showtime, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Metal Atamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You trying to pull a number on me, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wait on the\Nline because I'm so fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we shall see who's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon Digimolk 2? Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SaberLeomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I see we've been\Ntakin' our vitamins,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's time to put the\Ncat out with the garbage.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.86,0:12:41.69,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}SaberLeomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.86,0:12:41.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.86,0:12:41.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.86,0:12:41.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ancient Beast Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.86,0:12:41.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attacks
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.86,0:12:41.69,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,338,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Nail Crusher\N\N\N\NInfinity Arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saber Leomon may have a heart of gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he'll crush his opponents\Nwith his claws of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now run before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nail Crusher!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna sit here and watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijirun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijirun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gamma Mons! Nijirun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nijirun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, please let me fight with them! Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need me. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi? Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to help him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you think it's a better\Nidea to leave like he told us to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twin fangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really think we'd better\Nleave before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Leomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call that your best shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nothing if you want a real\Nchallenge, it's right here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon, don't be ridiculous,\Nyou're no match for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, I can take on\Nthis tin can if I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in no shape to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop it and quit trying to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.68,0:14:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, everyone's welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, little darling, today\NI'm offering a special group discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it saves me time\Nto destroy all you at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jigimon, Jigimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jigimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End to ultamin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leon-mon, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, that didn't even faze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My metal's Chromadigizoid, the\Nabsolute strongest metal there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe you'd like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MULCAN'S HAMMER!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what you attempt, it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuz I'm invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm breaking apart. This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost my luster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this keep happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because my hammer is made\Nof Chromadigizoid metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it isn't your moment to shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twin Fang! Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No pain, Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I've got it\Ncovered! Get moving! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cory, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:15:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shadow Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It fizzled out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha, I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy housewarming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me too! Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I look like I want your company?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppetmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time! Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do some major damage\Nand I want no fall-ups!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.94,0:16:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daydreaming again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Metal Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.22,0:16:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sock it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, you're supposed to obey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're washed up, Puppetmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's gonna be on your side\Nbecause you don't care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still strong, and it\Ndoesn't matter what they think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still gonna do\Nwhat I tell them to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Karuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cherrymon, what is it that those\Nkids have that I don't... Friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outlet Pumenbun's been defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forest is disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.33,0:17:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of\Nhere and find a safe place!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lihuman, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stupid toilet paper isn't\Ngonna be any good this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forest...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.44,0:18:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the forest is disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a sign that something\Npositive has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends must have defeated\NPuppetmon. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expected that they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Leomon, please don't leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We depend on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.78,0:18:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no reason to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must go now and rejuvenate\Nmyself at the primary village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon, I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time for us to resolve\Nthings, but I promise we will meet up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a good rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, let's go to the primary village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we need help, and if\Nwhat Leomon said is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll meet some old friends there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be just great to\Nsee Chuumon and Piximon again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then the matter's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.52,0:19:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're making a trip to find\Nthe primary village, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was destroyed after the Dark\NMasters poisoned it with their evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one is left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will never return to the way it was\Nuntil the Dark Masters are eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we throw them out\Nand then save the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better than sitting\Naround and doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way out of this mess\Nis to defeat the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you up for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need your help, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Leomon and everyone, the\Nwhole Digi-World needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:19:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right, Palmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sniveling is for babies, and I've\Ndone too much of that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon, are you going\Nto come along with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have no intention of\Njoining forces with you crazy kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if we all happen to be going\Nthe same way, I'm stuck tagging along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ogremon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't blow your cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that it's decided, we\Nneed to seek out a few allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.79,0:20:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be others\Nwho are willing to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Dark Masters and\Nget their hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they're out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to find them, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Princess, how about if we come\Nalong to help out? No way. Huh? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only if you stop calling me\NPrincess and call me Mimi instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our pleasure, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So can we come now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some call this a crossroads in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the past, I might have\Navoided it by going to the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know, it feels\Ngood to do the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though at times that might be a\Ndangerous thing, which we may soon find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.06,0:21:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will be stronger than
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one thing I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,am now with the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courage to take the courage\Nto the heart of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:22:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can still see the future I am
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now with the future of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still the beginning of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.68,0:23:01.69,Sign,,0,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}Orders to Bomb! Mugendramon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

